Package: PsyLingLLM
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Psycholinguistic Experiments with Large Language Models
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Han",
    family = "Ming",
    email = "hanmingpsy@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides tools for designing and running controlled
    psycholinguistic, psychological, cognitive, and educational experiments
    with large language models. Registry-based configuration separates models,
    providers, and application programming interfaces so that compatible
    services can share experimental designs. Functions support randomized and
    factorial trials, multi-turn conversations, response and reasoning capture,
    timing and token measurements, and structured result export.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
